        "rationale": "The terms go up by 3, so the coefficient of $n$ is 3, not 1."
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "content": "$3n + 5$",
        "rationale": "When $n = 1$, $3n + 5 = 8$: the first term would be 8, not 5."
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "content": "$5n + 3$",
        "rationale": "The first term is not the coefficient of $n$: the common difference is."
      }
    ],
